{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{"tools":{},"prompts":{}},"serverInfo":{"name":"mojo-anything","title":"mojo-anything: port code to Mojo","version":"0.1.0"},"instructions":"Incremental migration to Mojo of TypeScript/JavaScript, Python, C, Go, Ruby, Java and Kotlin code, one unit at a time, the original's callers keeping their API. Loop per unit: analyze -> bridge -> record -> (write the port in port.mojo) -> build -> diff -> shadow -> gate. Never mark a port done before gate passes. A whole app: app_record -> app_front_door (mojo/app) -> the loop and app_wire per unit -> app_lift."}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"prompts":[{"name":"port_unit","title":"Port one unit to Mojo","description":"Port one unit of a repository to Mojo: analyze, bridge, record, port it in port.mojo, build, diff, shadow, gate.","arguments":[{"name":"path","description":"Repository root.","required":true},{"name":"unit","description":"Unit id from analyze; the best first port from `start_here` when omitted.","required":false}]},{"name":"port_whole_app","title":"Port a whole app to Mojo","description":"Rewrite a whole app (CLI, server or library) as a pure Mojo app: grill the decisions, record the app, put a Mojo front door in mojo/app, port every unit, lift.","arguments":[{"name":"path","description":"Repository root.","required":true}]}]}}
